{"id":"caza","lemma":"caza","pos":"noun","rank":1634,"glosses":["hunting, hunt (act of finding and killing a wild animal; art of hunting)","persecution, hunting (act of pursuing in a manner to injure, grieve, or afflict)","game (wild animals hunted for food; meat of these animals)"],"ipa":"/ˈkaθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cazas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-caza.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tienes licencia de caza?","en":"Do you have a hunting license?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333712","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"license"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"¿Preferiría ir a pescar o ir de caza?","en":"Would you rather go fishing or go hunting?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608403","words":[{"g":"to prefer","l":"preferir"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to fish"},{"g":"or"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"to be about"]]},{"text":"El perro fue a la caza del conejo.","en":"The dog chased the rabbit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693778","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"rabbit, cony, coney"}]},{"text":"¿Es legal la caza de armadillos?","en":"Is hunting armadillos legal?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"legal"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ahora está prohibida la caza.","en":"Hunting is forbidden now.","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"forbidden","l":"prohibido"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}